@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@supplierId = 7

### Lister les fournisseurs
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers?q=tech&page=0&size=20&sort=name,asc
Accept: application/json

### Créer un fournisseur
POST {{baseUrl}}/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Tech Distribution",
  "contactName": "Amina Nguema",
  "email": "contact@tech-distribution.example",
  "phone": "+237690000000",
  "address": "Douala, Cameroun"
}

### Consulter un fournisseur et ses coordonnées
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/{{supplierId}}
Accept: application/json

### Modifier un fournisseur
PUT {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/{{supplierId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Tech Distribution SARL",
  "contactName": "Amina Nguema",
  "email": "contact@tech-distribution.example",
  "phone": "+237690000000",
  "address": "Bonanjo, Douala, Cameroun"
}

### Supprimer un fournisseur — échoue s’il est référencé
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/{{supplierId}}
Accept: application/json
